    "name": "City Of Corals",
    "steam_appid": 2393460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/1213859c97f0340209e757353f504058.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>Play as the little sea bunny who has just arrived at a bleached coral city. Collect algae and learn about how corals grow, explore areas based on the different reef zones and even recruit some of the many fish species to help sea bunny find their way through town!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/b04595302fc053059980905132130ebc.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>The city has been created entirely by hand from real paper and card and carefully photographed to create the unique visuals, along with watercolour illustrations for the creatures and corals! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/a524de6359b11a769fbd35012f153ecd.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>Discover how the coral ecosystem functions as you play. Learn through doing as you interact with the creatures and environments!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/1213859c97f0340209e757353f504058.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>Play as the little sea bunny who has just arrived at a bleached coral city. Collect algae and learn about how corals grow, explore areas based on the different reef zones and even recruit some of the many fish species to help sea bunny find their way through town!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/b04595302fc053059980905132130ebc.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>The city has been created entirely by hand from real paper and card and carefully photographed to create the unique visuals, along with watercolour illustrations for the creatures and corals! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393460/extras/a524de6359b11a769fbd35012f153ecd.avif?t=1737552626\" /></span><br>Discover how the coral ecosystem functions as you play. Learn through doing as you interact with the creatures and environments!",
